# Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_by_earth) with the quest completed. A level 75 Summoner with Trial by Earth
# completed and a Tuning Fork of Earth: BattlefieldQuest's check (completed is past accepted) holds: the menu; area 1
# entered (checkSkipCutscene: completed: skippable), the fork taken; Titan_Prime_TBE killed: WON; the win: not
# accepted: no battlefieldWin, 32001 (canSkipCS 1); finished: nothing (the quest's handler: not accepted: nothing).
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth completed
keyitem TuningForkOfEarth
login
trigger EP_Entrance                     # completed, the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: entered (skippable), the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill GALGALIM-3                         # WON; 32001 (canSkipCS 1)
finish                                  # nothing
